 @startuml
user->SearchService: search dataset by title and metadata
SearchService-->Database: retrieve matching datasets
Database-->>SearchService: list of matching datasets
user<-- SearchService: list of matching datasets
@enduml

 @startuml
actor Admin
actor User1
actor User2
database UserDatabase
participant ActivityTracker

Admin -> ActivityTracker: Request all users' activities
ActivityTracker --> UserDatabase: Retrieve user activity data
UserDatabase --> ActivityTracker: Provide user activity details

Activate ActivityTracker

ActivityLoop(ActivityTracker, User1) {
    ActivityTracker -- User1: Notify of each activity
    Note right of User1: ... (display chat messages, file accesses, etc.)
}

ActivityLoop(ActivityTracker, User2) {
    ActivityTracker -- User2: Notify of each activity
    Note right of User2: ... (display chat messages, file accesses, etc.)
}

deactivate ActivityTracker

@enduml

